fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"base/gstadapter.html#gst_adapter_available_fast","fragment":"\n\tgst_adapter_available_fast\n\n\n\tGstBase.Adapter.prototype.available_fast\n\n\n\tGstBase.Adapter.available_fast\n\nGets the maximum number of bytes that can be retrieved in a single map\noperation without merging buffers.\nCalling gst_adapter_map with the amount of bytes returned by this function\nwill never require any expensive operations (like copying the data into a\ntemporary buffer).\nParameters:\na GstAdapter\nnumber of bytes that are available in adapter without expensive\noperations\nGets the maximum number of bytes that can be retrieved in a single map\noperation without merging buffers.\nCalling GstBase.Adapter.prototype.map with the amount of bytes returned by this function\nwill never require any expensive operations (like copying the data into a\ntemporary buffer).\nParameters:\na GstBase.Adapter\nnumber of bytes that are available in adapter without expensive\noperations\nGets the maximum number of bytes that can be retrieved in a single map\noperation without merging buffers.\nCalling GstBase.Adapter.map with the amount of bytes returned by this function\nwill never require any expensive operations (like copying the data into a\ntemporary buffer).\nParameters:\na GstBase.Adapter\nnumber of bytes that are available in adapter without expensive\noperations\n"});